		{"id":"a9af019382de78f2","type":"text","text":"subtext","x":4580,"y":-776,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"4e3ec084c712fe50","type":"text","text":"N-Nothing’s wrong. Just an old man worrying too much. It's just-","x":2750,"y":-683,"width":250,"height":103,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cdcf0870601affdd","type":"text","text":"Device beeping","x":2750,"y":-580,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"eec8c9a3cbbb515d","type":"text","text":"_Intensity detected at location... FORTRESS_","x":2750,"y":-520,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b0aa96560292c35b","type":"text","text":"Karma's sending the Fortress Troopers here....","x":2750,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":84,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f4200c9484967f07","type":"text","text":"Fortress? Where's that?","x":2750,"y":-376,"width":250,"height":56,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d224098284021317","type":"text","text":"It's past Pura Renon, you should-","x":2750,"y":-320,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c5d34dae6c21ea94","type":"text","text":"-= Screaming =-","x":2750,"y":-260,"width":250,"height":70},
		{"id":"c033f0e30ba2f5c7","type":"text","text":"You should go, hurry!","x":2750,"y":-190,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"661006aacb722294","type":"text","text":"Well done, friend! I knew you’d manage it!","x":3000,"y":-1147,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"617ba505a74f0195","type":"text","text":"You made it! The power’s really back, and thanks to you Dad’s pacemaker is going to work again!","x":3000,"y":-1087,"width":250,"height":131,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"28ab8ca58a1608c0","type":"text","text":"I was so scared earlier, I didn’t mean to say those words... Thank you for everything.","x":3000,"y":-955,"width":250,"height":116,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dfd9d330b8302d06","type":"text","text":"I’m glad I could help; that’s enough for me.","x":3000,"y":-839,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"316772ac950e0467","type":"text","text":"Did you saw the plasma screen? Is that what you were hinting at before I left?","x":3000,"y":-759,"width":250,"height":128,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"14b0a26cac74ccfc","type":"text","text":"I'm afraid so, Karma has always been so over-catious on rebel activities that-","x":3000,"y":-631,"width":250,"height":81,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fc00a2871a64734b","type":"text","text":"Karma's Threat","x":4169,"y":-1725,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"57b0a5f5899df5db","type":"text","text":"How touching... You have power returns to your pathethic slums.","x":4170,"y":-1665,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7f32e22725f36d69","type":"text","text":"Make no mistake... Your walls stood because I did not topple them. Your food, your water, your worthless little homes. all of it belongs to me. Me! And someone among you has forgotten that.","x":4170,"y":-1572,"width":250,"height":225,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"136aa381df6fbc6c","type":"text","text":"Celebrate while you can, worms. Because soon, as I march to your pathethic slum. Your precious lights will never shine again.","x":4170,"y":-1347,"width":250,"height":175,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b1498e6396779931","type":"text","text":"All of you have been warned.","x":4170,"y":-1172,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
